### Verify: aynı token tekrar (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "b8c5156c01bf2c39e7d0640f5940a91f1e5c2e7234fd16b5fa2869cdb525a8f9" }

### Verify: uydurma token (400 INVALID_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "abc123" }

### Resend: kayıtlı olmayan e-posta (200, aynı cevap)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yok@example.com" }

### Resend: doğrulanmamış hesap (200, konsolda yeni link)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ayse2@example.com" }

### Login: doğrulanmamış hesap (403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "mehmet@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Login: yanlış şifre (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "yanlis-sifre" }

### Login: olmayan e-posta (401, aynı mesaj)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yok@example.com", "password": "yanlis-sifre" }

### Login: doğru bilgiler (200, accessToken döner)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### Me: token ile (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Me: token yok (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Me: bozuk token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi

### 1) Login: cevapta Set-Cookie başlığına bak, gövdede refreshToken olmamalı
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### 2) Refresh: yeni accessToken, yeni cookie (değeri değişmeli)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 3) Refresh: tekrar (her seferinde yeni token, 200)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 1) Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ali@example.com", "password": "gizli12345" }

### 2) Logout (204, Set-Cookie ile cookie siliniyor)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### 3) Refresh: cookie yok (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/refresh

### 4) Logout tekrar (yine 204, idempotent)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

